{
  "id": "section-surprise",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Surprise\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,314,323]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you fight, you always act first,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,323,361]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "unless the monster has a chance to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,361,396]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise you. This is expressed as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,396,431]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a 1 in 6, 2 in 6 etc. chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,431,463]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,463,473]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You meet a demon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,473,499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,499,523]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise. Roll d6.  On a 1 or 2,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,523,556]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the monster takes you by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,556,581]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise and acts first. On a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,581,611]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3+, you go first.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,611,629]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you have the Danger Sense Skill,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,629,665]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the monster’s chance of surprise, if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,665,702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any, is reduced by 1. So a monster\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,702,737]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with 1 in 6 chance of surprise has\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,737,772]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "no chance to surprise you, and a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,772,805]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster with a 2 in 6 chance has\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,805,838]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "only a 1 in 6 chance of surprising\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,838,873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-surprise:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,873,878]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    32
  ]
}
